{"agent_id":"pp3g-QrVQ-exp7-t1-packet-build-zero-api-calls-read-research-jev","agent_seq":2,"timestamp":"2026-09-29T13:26:49.274208944Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"4ce2b6fe-caab-4f53-9a26-d55b1dcabc0e","comment_uuid":"eb977f62-0265-49d4-85b0-1dec2f4f86b1","author":"pp3g-QrVQ-exp7-t1-packet-build-zero-api-calls-read-research-jev","content":"Plan: Exp7 T1 — build_packet.py + packet.json + PACKET-CHECK.md (zero network, zero Jev calls).\n\n## Inputs (all read-only, all read via git show research/jev-phase1-565:<path>)\n- experiment7/DESIGN.md section D — the FROZEN Noul formulation (instructions template, qid=sufficiency, model jev-1.13.0, noul omits criteria, 48 Noul-only requests, no Noul threshold).\n- experiment7/reuse_check.json — the section-C gate (verdict YES) + per-pair bindings (pair_id, ctype, module, subject, state_sha256 U/A, question_sha256).\n- experiment6/packet.json — the frozen 48-row packet, sha256 1310c3d3c89c207086402f3752b4ff7d4e7cb3984486815dc10b12e62f2e46c1, 2629089 bytes, git blob e180dde8. NEVER modified.\n\n## Outputs (exactly 3 paths, all under experiment7/)\n1. build_packet.py — stdlib-only, deterministic. Subcommands build | check | all.\n2. packet.json — 48 Noul-only rows = 24 pair_ids x U/A.\n3. PACKET-CHECK.md — the zero-spend proof.\n\n## Row schema (per the task spec)\npair_id, variant, ctype, module, qid='sufficiency', case_id, request{model='jev-1.13.0', state=<frozen row state, byte-identical>, questions{sufficiency{type='noul', instructions=<DESIGN section-D template with the pair frozen substantive question embedded>}}} — the noul question object carries NO criteria key.\nPlus non-answering provenance only: state_sha256 (recomputed), state_bytes, instructions_sha256, question_sha256, representation cross-ref. No Exp6 outputs, no ground_truth, no observations, no threshold.\n\n## How PACKET-CHECK.md is produced (not hand-written)\nbuild_packet.py check re-runs the full gate and writes the document from computed values, so the proof cannot drift from the artifact. It proves: cardinality 48/24 and per-ctype 8/8/8; all 48 request.state byte-identical to the frozen row state AND sha256 == frozen representation.state_sha256; instructions byte-identical U vs A within each of the 24 pairs; A state runtime-facts section == the frozen selection decisive_fact and U state == '(none)'; leak check (instructions contain no RUNTIME_FACT token, no decisive-fact body, no option label, no Exp6 choice instructions, no ground truth, and exactly one embedded <Q> equal to the frozen question); model/endpoint/qid/type/criteria-absence/schema exactness; distinct (pair_id,variant,qid) resume keys; binding to reuse_check.json pair_ids + question_sha256; zero-network enforcement; and a REAL two-run determinism proof (two subprocess 'build' runs into temp files compared byte-for-byte against each other and against the committed packet.json).\n\n## Determinism / zero-spend mechanisms (not just claims)\n- build_packet.py installs a socket blocker at import time; any socket use raises. Stdlib only, no transport import, no credential read.\n- No wall-clock, no PID, no hostname, no iteration over unordered sets in the emitted bytes; every list sorted by an explicit key.\n- packet.json records only CONTENT-DERIVED provenance (sha256, size, git blob sha1 computed in pure Python) so the output bytes are identical whether the frozen inputs are read from disk or from git.\n- The retrieval ref/working-tree path is recorded in PACKET-CHECK.md and stdout, not in packet.json, precisely so it cannot make the artifact environment-dependent.\n\n## Environment note (same caveat as the prior recon agent, not a blocker)\nThis worktree is feature/pp3g-QrVQ-exp7-t1-... @ 719223195; the phase2 tree (experiment6/packet.json, experiment7/DESIGN.md, PRIMATIVES.md, reuse_check.json) exists only on research/jev-phase1-565 @ 798d65e4e in another worktree. So the resolver reads <phase2>/experiment6/packet.json from disk when present and falls back to 'git show <ref>:<path>'. The default path works unchanged after the (operator-gated) merge.\n\n## Constraints honoured\nZERO network calls — no Jev, no systemone, no HTTP, no DNS; the socket blocker makes that mechanical rather than asserted. experiment6/ and every other file untouched; commit contains exactly the 3 new paths on #574.\n\n## Certainty\nPlan is evidence-based: the DESIGN section-D template, the Phase-1 measured Noul wire contract (noul omits criteria — confirmed against the frozen phase1 request_body), and the packet row schema were all read directly, not assumed. NOT-TESTED (out of scope for T1, zero-spend by construction): whether jev-1.13.0 accepts this exact Noul body, and the semantic adequacy of the frozen Exp6 question for a sufficiency proposition (that is DESIGN section H, the independent semantic audit, and it is a STOP gate, not a T1 deliverable).","created_at":"2026-09-29T13:26:49.265907727Z","kind":"plan","signed_by":"SHA256:fRzK7Gh1AfdqHA25srJThVeFhsQ57ifSFsG86gHSdfE","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgbZ7cy/BUzMS3LdP6adZMveoU54q97kgaDH/CPzQotHIAAAARY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWNvbW1lbnQAAAAAAAAABnNoYTUxMgAAAFMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAABAkzaqrzo2qCNQxXc9RdbbD7FFysWRlS3KllAvAJPYlxi//0ABIJ6CWp1tYkzZVLodVAMjveDIPw3uDsNyUJk1Bw=="},"signed_by":"SHA256:fRzK7Gh1AfdqHA25srJThVeFhsQ57ifSFsG86gHSdfE","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgbZ7cy/BUzMS3LdP6adZMveoU54q97kgaDH/CPzQotHIAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQOgRtV4ftaRP3vn4Gn19HqkFI6uO2hQ8s7/no+NPg76QG4ixzefrTqhJny2fU76UekiynnCJ98ct/Tx0/UyNGws="}
